  "richContent": "<p>仓位 &amp; 收益率</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>【150】仓位变动 </p>\n<p></p>\n<p>A：44.85% → 43.52% </p>\n<p></p>\n<p>H：9.38% → 9.45% </p>\n<p></p>\n<p>A+H：54.23% → 52.97% </p>\n<p></p>\n<p>股：57.03% → 55.75% </p>\n<p></p>\n<p>债：14.12% → 14.05% </p>\n<p></p>\n<p>现金：28.85% → 30.20% </p>\n<p></p>\n<p>--\t\t\t </p>\n<p></p>\n<p>行业：19.09% → 17.74% </p>\n<p></p>\n<p>消费：5.65% → 4.99% </p>\n<p></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p></p>\n<p>【S】仓位变动 </p>\n<p></p>\n<p>A：65.67% → 62.79% </p>\n<p></p>\n<p>H：13.43% → 13.48% </p>\n<p></p>\n<p>A+H：79.10% → 76.27% </p>\n<p></p>\n<p>股：83.28% → 80.37% </p>\n<p></p>\n<p>债：15.07% → 14.89% </p>\n<p></p>\n<p>现金：1.65% → 4.74% </p>\n<p></p>\n<p>-- \t\t\t </p>\n<p></p>\n<p>行业：32.84% → 30.15% </p>\n<p></p>\n<p>消费：12.13% → 11.06%</p>\n<p></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p></p>\n<p>积极响应「组合清晰明了」的大方针，同时，更符合仓位管理本身的定义：持仓市值占比%，减少总有拿份数算占比的误会，仓位旭日图上的【份数】去掉了。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<img src=\"https://cdn-community.qieman.com/558AD864-2B00-4203-8764-583E716E0720.png\" />\n<img src=\"https://cdn-community.qieman.com/6F1B1A07-A58C-4BB2-BD68-3F65EED2E6F4.png\" />\n<img src=\"https://cdn-community.qieman.com/207BC210-ED43-4578-8F76-10AD15E0C688.png\" />\n<img src=\"https://cdn-community.qieman.com/515CF278-5B22-4FD2-B523-CA7BDED47672.png\" />\n<img src=\"https://cdn-community.qieman.com/FAAF6000-1F76-4790-9064-A9AD3A55302A.png\" />\n<img src=\"https://cdn-community.qieman.com/37D756FB-0CDB-4B33-85B3-2577A141D050.png\" />\n<img src=\"https://cdn-community.qieman.com/412C6561-7F80-408B-96A8-E8544E9483A0.png\" />\n<img src=\"https://cdn-community.qieman.com/C093DB12-DFEF-4EAD-9FFC-F87D44F5A7C0.png\" />",
